	('96ac9ff7-5d2b-46cc-a888-3bf1fcee6147', 'lang-ja', NULL, NULL, 'gp-dake', NULL, NULL, 'historical-grammar', 'だけ derives from the noun 丈 (take) meaning height or limit.', 'The original sense of limit or boundary directly explains its modern function. だけ marks the extent or amount of something, setting a clear boundary around what is included. The word naturally expresses the concept of a limit or boundary.', '{}', 'Edo', 'attested', false, true, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'claude', 1, 'claude-haiku-4-5', 'etymology-word-v1', '7aac2324-c1bd-45c0-98d4-a41e4fe19fa1', 'e765d564-330e-445c-a492-bca1a0813762', '2026-08-26 10:32:02.243', NULL, '2026-08-26 10:32:02.243', '2026-08-26 06:50:16.235447', '2026-09-05 15:54:42.614084'),
